msgstr "定義済み関数から始める"

#: ../../source/explore/dynamic_transformers.rst:361
msgid ""
"``chemotools`` includes common, picklable functions "
"in :mod:`chemotools.adaptation.functions`. Using one of these is the "
"shortest path to a dynamic correction:"
msgstr ""
"``chemotools`` は、一般的で pickle 化可能な関数"
